# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Personal machine data. None of this belongs in the repo: it describes one
# specific pinball machine (or one person's shows) and is regenerated or
# re-selected by whoever clones this. server.py recreates every folder below
# on startup, so a fresh clone works with all of it missing.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Light maps and light/tag files exported from a real machine
lightmaps/
!lightmaps/README.md

# Shows you author here, and the MPF YAML they export to
shows/
exports/

# MPF shows pulled in from a machine folder
imports/

# Playfield photos
backgrounds/

# Remembered folder/file choices, including absolute paths to your machine
config.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build and editor noise
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
server.log
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
